            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qur'an Arabic is set in the AlQuran IndoPak typeface by Ayman Siddiqui and R. Siddiqua, created for QuranWBW.com and Quran.com and used here with attribution as Sadaqa-e-Jaria. Urdu text is set in Noto Nastaliq Urdu, with Amiri Quran bundled as a fallback (both under the SIL Open Font License 1.1)."
