    "Times are calculated with %@. Around %@, %@ is in common use, and Fajr and Isha can differ between them by 15 to 30 minutes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Times are calculated with %@. Around %@, %@ is in common use, and Fajr and Isha can differ between them by 15 to 30 minutes."
          }
        },
        "ur": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "اوقات %1$@ کے طریقے سے نکالے جا رہے ہیں۔ %2$@ کے علاقے میں عموماً %3$@ رائج ہے، اور دونوں میں فجر اور عشاء کا فرق 15 سے 30 منٹ تک ہو سکتا ہے۔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daily Zikr appears here, live, when the session begins. Turn on a reminder below to be told when.": {
